     "Hi all, <div><br></div><div>I am trying to run the following model in Lavaan, in which AM, RM, and CU are latent variables. It also has three control variables (CV1, CV2, and CV3).</div><div><img alt=\"Screenshot 2023-08-09 140516.png\" width=\"535px\" height=\"279px\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/attach/1ee3d706aa9fd/Screenshot%202023-08-09%20140516.png?part=0.2&amp;view=1\"><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"></div><div><br></div><div><div>I have written the code that is included at the end of the post.  I have two doubts: </div><div>Should I also include the CV when calculating the total effect, and indirect effects? If so, how should I do it?</div><div><br></div><div><div>When I get the output, everything seems to work fine, but for the total effect and the indirect effects, for which I cannot get the standard error or the P value. It is shown like this: </div><div><img alt=\"Screenshot 2023-08-09 141038.png\" width=\"535px\" height=\"417px\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/attach/1ee3d706aa9fd/Screenshot%202023-08-09%20141038.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\"><br></div><br></div><div><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span><b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(68,114,196)\">#First set of mediators</span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">AF\r\n~ a1*X + c1*CV1 + c2*CV2 + c3*CV3</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">AK\r\n~ a2*X + c4*CV1 + c5*CV2 + c6*CV3</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">AC\r\n~ a3*X + c7*CV1 + c8*CV2 + c9*CV3</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span><b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(68,114,196)\">#Second set of mediators</span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">AM\r\n~ b1*AF + b4*AK + b7*AC + c10*CV1+c11*CV2+c12*CV3</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">RM\r\n~ b2*AF + b5*AK + b8*AC + c13*CV1+c14*CV2+c15*CV3</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">CU\r\n~ b3*AF + b6*AK + b9*AC + c16*CV1+c17*CV2+c18*CV3</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(68,114,196)\">#Third mediator</span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">CM\r\n~ d1*AM + d2*RM + d3*CU + c19*CV1 + c20*CV2 + c21*CV3</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(68,114,196)\">#Fourth mediator</span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">RP\r\n~ e1*AM + e2*RM + e3*CU + f1*CM + c22*CV1 + c23*CV2 + c24*CV3</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(68,114,196)\">#Direct effect</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Y\r\n~ g1*RP + z1*X + h1*AM + h2*RM + h3*CU + c25*CV1 + c26*CV2 + c27*CV3</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(68,114,196)\">#Indirect effects</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff1:=a1*b1*d1*f1*g1</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff2:=a1*b2*d2*f1*g1</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff3:=a1*b3*d3*f1*g1</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff4:=a2*b4*d1*f1*g1</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff5:=a2*b5*d2*f1*g1</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff6:=a2*b6*d3*f1*g1</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff7:=a3*b7*d1*f1*g1</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff8:=a3*b8*d2*f1*g1</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff9:=a3*b9*d3*f1*g1</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff10:=a1*b1*e1*g1</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff11:=a1*b2*e2*g1</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff12:=a1*b3*e3*g1</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff13:=a2*b4*e1*g1</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff14:=a2*b5*e2*g1</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff15:=a2*b6*e3*g1</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff16:=a3*b7*e1*g1</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff17:=a3*b8*e2*g1</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff18:=a3*b9*e3*g1</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff19:=a1*b1*h1</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff20:=a1*b2*h2</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff21:=a1*b3*h3</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff22:=a2*b4*h1</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff23:=a2*b5*h2</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff24:=a2*b6*h3</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff25:=a3*b7*h1</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff36:=a3*b8*h2</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ind_eff27:=a3*b9*h3</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(68,114,196)\">#Total effect</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">total:=\r\nz1 + (a1*b1*d1*f1*g1) + (a1*b2*d2*f1*g1) + (a1*b3*d3*f1*g1) +\r\n(a2*b4*d1*f1*g1)  + (a2*b5*d2*f1*g1) +\r\n(a2*b6*d3*f1*g1) + (a3*b7*d1*f1*g1) + (a3*b8*d2*f1*g1) + (a3*b9*d3*f1*g1) +\r\n(a1*b1*e1*g1) + (a1*b2*e2*g1) + (a1*b3*e3*g1) + (a2*b4*e1*g1) + </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"ES-MX\" style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">(a2*b5*e2*g1) + (a2*b6*e3*g1) + (a3*b7*e1*g1) +\r\n(a3*b8*e2*g1) + (a3*b9*e3*g1) + (a1*b1*h1) + (a1*b2*h2) + (a1*b3*h3) +\r\n(a2*b4*h1) + (a2*b5*h2) + (a2*b6*h3) + (a3*b7*h1) + (a3*b8*h2) + (a3*b9*h3)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&#39;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(68,114,196)\">#Estimate parameters</span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">fit_medmed\r\n&lt;- sem(medmed, data=smart, <a href=\"http://std.lv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://std.lv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792415681108000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1xPHQK4N4yRR4Ad3XKyph5\">std.lv</a>=TRUE, meanstructure=TRUE, estimator =\r\n&quot;ML&quot;, se=&quot;bootstrap&quot;)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(68,114,196)\">#Request Output from SEM</span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:200%\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">summary(fit_medmed,\r\nfit.measures=TRUE, standardized=TRUE)</span></p></div><div><br></div><div>Thank you very much for your time. </div><div><br></div><div>Cecilia</div><div><br></div></div>"
